WEBVTT

00:45.837 --> 00:48.172
THEY WERE STARTLED
AND FRIGHTENED,

00:48.173 --> 00:50.466
THINKING THEY SAW A GHOST.

00:50.467 --> 00:52.552
HE SAID TO THEM,

00:53.803 --> 00:57.056
"WHY ARE YOU TROUBLED, AND WHY
DO DOUBTS RISE IN YOUR MINDS?

00:57.057 --> 00:58.682
LOOK AT MY HANDS AND MY FEET.

00:58.683 --> 01:00.517
IT IS I MYSELF!
TOUCH ME AND SEE;

01:00.518 --> 01:03.896
A GHOST DOES NOT HAVE FLESH
AND BONES, AS YOU SEE I HAVE."

01:03.897 --> 01:06.191
LUKE 24:37-39

02:34.404 --> 02:36.739
It's still dawn. What is it?

02:37.574 --> 02:39.075
Somebody died.

02:40.076 --> 02:41.119
Who?

02:43.246 --> 02:46.958
- You know Cho the ginseng farmer?
- Yeah.

02:48.042 --> 02:49.669
His wife died.

02:52.088 --> 02:54.674
It's raining buckets.

02:56.759 --> 02:59.012
Hey, where are you off to?

02:59.596 --> 03:01.181
Somebody died.

03:01.723 --> 03:02.849
Who?

03:03.516 --> 03:06.977
The wife of the ginseng farmer.

03:06.978 --> 03:08.396
That's all I know.

03:08.938 --> 03:11.357
But she's so young.

03:11.941 --> 03:13.483
You said it.

03:13.484 --> 03:16.862
- Have some breakfast before you go.
- I gotta hurry.

03:16.863 --> 03:18.530
Just a bite!

03:18.531 --> 03:23.035
- Hurrying won't bring back the dead.
- But I need to go now.

03:23.036 --> 03:25.371
I said eat before you go.

03:25.955 --> 03:26.956
Come on.

03:31.878 --> 03:33.171
What happened?

03:34.172 --> 03:37.466
I said I don't know.
They think she was murdered.

03:37.467 --> 03:40.428
What kind of bastard kills people?

03:41.221 --> 03:42.513
Damn son of a bitch.

03:44.766 --> 03:46.017
Someone died?

03:48.645 --> 03:50.646
Eat up, dear.

03:50.647 --> 03:51.981
Who died?

03:55.985 --> 03:57.111
Eat your breakfast.

04:00.907 --> 04:02.408
Bye, Dad.

04:31.729 --> 04:34.357
- You're so late!
- Gimme a raincoat.

04:34.857 --> 04:37.735
What took you so long?
Two people are dead.

04:38.820 --> 04:40.113
Where's the captain?

04:41.155 --> 04:43.408
- He went to Seoul, remember?
- Right.

04:43.908 --> 04:45.743
- Hurry up!
- I'm coming.

05:10.310 --> 05:13.938
I'm right here. Look at me, Heung-guk!

05:18.735 --> 05:22.488
Let go of me! That's my nephew!

05:27.660 --> 05:28.661
Jong-gu!

05:31.706 --> 05:36.753
He didn't do it!
I'm telling you he didn't do it!

05:43.718 --> 05:44.886
Hello, Sergeant.

05:49.057 --> 05:53.101
Looks like he did it with this.
Jabbed him 20 times.

05:53.102 --> 05:54.395
Holy shit.

05:59.650 --> 06:00.735
What's that?

06:01.319 --> 06:05.198
I don't think he killed him here.
He dragged the body back to this place.

06:05.823 --> 06:07.408
Pretty brutal.

06:07.950 --> 06:11.913
- That's Cho, the husband?
- Looks that way.

06:13.498 --> 06:14.791
I'll be damned.

06:19.128 --> 06:21.839
- And the kid?
- We took him to a relative's.

06:26.636 --> 06:28.011
Why did he do it?

06:28.012 --> 06:30.597
Don't smell booze on him,
but he won't talk.

06:30.598 --> 06:34.769
He must be high on something.
Why else would he sit there like that?

06:36.479 --> 06:38.897
What the hell happened?

06:38.898 --> 06:41.442
Sergeant, how have you been?

06:44.946 --> 06:48.825
That's my nephew! Let go of me!

06:52.662 --> 06:55.206
That rotten bastard.

06:55.790 --> 07:00.670
Couldn't he use the GPS?
Why do I have to guide him?

07:02.171 --> 07:03.381
Isn't that it?

07:08.553 --> 07:10.596
- Get the wire cutters.
- Sir.

07:15.184 --> 07:16.561
Pull it back.

07:21.774 --> 07:23.443
What's with the stench?

07:25.236 --> 07:28.448
So, Cho was killed here.

07:29.782 --> 07:31.701
What the fuck is all this?

07:34.370 --> 07:37.747
So he invited Cho over, killed him,

07:37.748 --> 07:42.002
put the body in a sack, dragged it
to his house and killed his wife?

07:42.003 --> 07:44.046
A crime of passion.

07:44.547 --> 07:46.757
Make sure you photograph everything.

07:48.801 --> 07:52.138
Here, there, that stuff over there.

08:26.297 --> 08:29.382
- Jong-gu!
- Get over here.

08:29.383 --> 08:31.302
Sergeant, come over here.

08:34.847 --> 08:35.889
Shit!

08:35.890 --> 08:37.433
- Damn.
- That was slippery.

08:38.184 --> 08:39.185
Oh, man.

08:40.353 --> 08:42.021
That cocksucker.

08:44.190 --> 08:46.567
What kind of twisted freak is he?

09:07.213 --> 09:12.301
THE WAILING

12:01.512 --> 12:03.431
Pretty scary, isn't it?

12:09.395 --> 12:11.230
Scary, my ass.

12:12.982 --> 12:16.152
Anyway, that's the rumor in town.

12:16.736 --> 12:20.155
Who... told you that story?

12:20.156 --> 12:21.614
Byeong-gyu.

12:21.615 --> 12:24.535
That damn bastard.

12:25.202 --> 12:27.496
Now he's blabbering to you, too?

12:30.166 --> 12:35.671
But from what I hear, there's definitely
something about that guy.

12:36.255 --> 12:40.091
- Like what?
- The corner store owner went crazy.

12:40.092 --> 12:42.011
The guy at the mill dropped dead.

12:42.887 --> 12:45.681
- And then Heung-guk, two days ago.
- So?

12:46.265 --> 12:49.643
All this began
after that Japanese man arrived.

12:54.982 --> 13:01.572
Quit talking out of your ass,
you ignorant dope.

13:02.281 --> 13:04.449
Who are you calling ignorant?

13:04.450 --> 13:08.953
Look, the test results on Heung-guk
came back today.

13:08.954 --> 13:11.915
Apparently he ate
some bad fucking mushrooms.

13:11.916 --> 13:13.417
What?

13:14.001 --> 13:16.587
You know the ones that make you
lose your damn mind?

13:17.087 --> 13:19.799
His blood was full of that shit.

13:20.299 --> 13:23.052
There were tons
of those dried mushrooms at his place.

13:23.803 --> 13:25.678
You really believe that?

13:25.679 --> 13:27.597
That's what the results said.

13:27.598 --> 13:30.683
- Never tried those mushrooms as a kid?
- Hell, no.

13:30.684 --> 13:33.436
Eating mushrooms
wouldn't make you do that.

13:33.437 --> 13:37.900
You saw that poor fellow.
You think eating mushrooms can do that?

13:44.073 --> 13:46.826
But I'm right about the Japanese guy.

13:47.326 --> 13:49.744
If everyone's talking about him,

13:49.745 --> 13:52.414
it means there's a good reason.

13:59.255 --> 14:00.506
What the hell?

14:01.090 --> 14:03.759
Power's gone out again.

14:04.426 --> 14:06.177
Fuck.

14:06.178 --> 14:08.471
I keep telling the captain,

14:08.472 --> 14:12.016
if he has money for drinks,
he should get that damn wiring fixed.

14:12.017 --> 14:14.478
He never listens.

14:16.605 --> 14:18.189
What the fuck!

14:18.190 --> 14:21.401
- What's wrong?
- What the hell was that?

14:21.402 --> 14:23.027
- Look outside!
- What's outside?

14:23.028 --> 14:26.282
- Outside, that... Fuck!
- What's your problem?

14:27.908 --> 14:29.660
What is it, man?

14:30.661 --> 14:31.829
You check it out!

14:32.413 --> 14:34.122
- Me?
- Yes, you! Damn it!

14:34.123 --> 14:35.665
You want me to go out?

14:35.666 --> 14:38.502
I'm telling you, asshole!
Get your ass out there!

14:39.003 --> 14:41.546
- For crying out loud...
- Okay, I'll go.

14:41.547 --> 14:43.132
Come on, hurry!

14:44.008 --> 14:45.509
Shit.

14:46.093 --> 14:48.470
Who the fuck are you? What the hell?

15:05.571 --> 15:07.531
Stop, goddamn it!

15:09.992 --> 15:13.245
Stop it, you dirty slut! You whore.

15:28.052 --> 15:29.261
Eat this, too.

16:00.709 --> 16:02.252
Damn, you're heavy.

16:07.758 --> 16:11.595
- I'm getting too old for this.
- Don't be ridiculous.

16:12.888 --> 16:17.226
Old wives tell me
men still get it up after 70.

16:18.852 --> 16:24.775
Then buy me some herbal supplements.

16:25.275 --> 16:27.819
I keep having fucked-up nightmares.

16:27.820 --> 16:30.446
- What are you doing in there?
- Oh, hell. Shit!

16:30.447 --> 16:33.116
Nothing! Get away from the car.
Don't open it!

16:33.117 --> 16:36.077
- Don't open it!
- What are you doing?

16:36.078 --> 16:37.454
For crying out loud!

16:40.207 --> 16:44.211
STATIONERY STORE

16:45.629 --> 16:46.755
Dad.

16:49.008 --> 16:50.509
Dad?

16:54.304 --> 16:55.305
Look.

16:58.892 --> 16:59.893
How do I look?

17:01.228 --> 17:02.730
Pretty.

17:03.939 --> 17:05.816
Very pretty.

17:31.967 --> 17:33.343
How long were you watching?

17:36.597 --> 17:37.598
Huh?

17:39.516 --> 17:40.809
How much did you see?

17:42.311 --> 17:44.188
Don't worry. I won't tell.

17:48.192 --> 17:50.486
So you saw. You saw everything.

17:51.695 --> 17:54.323
No big deal. It's not the first time.

17:55.491 --> 17:56.492
What?

18:07.503 --> 18:09.671
- Here.
- What?

18:10.506 --> 18:13.383
It's okay. Have a sip.

18:39.076 --> 18:40.577
Hurry up!

18:48.377 --> 18:49.837
Son of a bitch!

18:51.755 --> 18:54.340
What took you so long?
Why didn't you pick up?

18:54.341 --> 18:58.010
My mother-in-law fell sick.

18:58.011 --> 19:01.222
You bastard, you always use her
as an excuse! You just took a nap!

19:01.223 --> 19:04.017
No, I didn't. I swear.

19:08.272 --> 19:11.066
Get to work!

19:15.154 --> 19:16.321
Excuse me, ma'am?

19:21.869 --> 19:23.287
What the hell?

19:27.583 --> 19:30.335
What are you doing? Stop her!

19:30.919 --> 19:31.920
Yes, sir.

19:32.629 --> 19:33.964
Come with me, ma'am.

19:35.549 --> 19:38.092
Get off me! Get--

19:38.093 --> 19:40.512
Sergeant, get her out of here.

19:42.055 --> 19:44.600
Back off, people.

19:46.977 --> 19:48.937
What's wrong with her?

19:50.647 --> 19:51.648
Oh, shit.

20:27.100 --> 20:28.852
Please calm down.

20:32.231 --> 20:33.899
That idiot...

20:45.953 --> 20:47.913
Calm down, ma'am.

21:00.342 --> 21:01.551
Jong-gu.

21:02.177 --> 21:03.929
Get cleaned up, man.

21:04.429 --> 21:06.682
Hey, don't beat yourself up.

21:07.266 --> 21:12.895
Ain't your fault that you're a girlie wimp
with balls the size of peas.

21:12.896 --> 21:14.397
Jeez.

21:14.398 --> 21:15.481
Hello!

21:15.482 --> 21:17.108
- Hey.
- Hi, Hyo-jin.

21:17.109 --> 21:18.276
Hello, Captain.

21:18.277 --> 21:20.486
- How are you?
- Good.

21:20.487 --> 21:22.948
- You got clean clothes for Daddy?
- Yeah.

21:29.413 --> 21:32.332
Mom got you clean boxers
and an undershirt.

21:33.709 --> 21:35.085
Thanks, darling.

21:36.086 --> 21:37.336
Take a shower.

21:37.337 --> 21:39.965
I will. Go home.

21:42.551 --> 21:46.220
You didn't even eat. Come on, Dad.

21:46.221 --> 21:52.394
All right, get out of here.
Can't you see Daddy's working?

22:00.652 --> 22:01.820
See you.

22:05.365 --> 22:06.450
Goodbye, officers.

22:07.034 --> 22:08.200
- Bye.
- See ya.

22:08.201 --> 22:09.745
- Take care, sweetie.
- Oh, my.

22:19.921 --> 22:22.924
That little brat.

22:31.475 --> 22:33.727
- Seong-bok?
- Yeah.

22:34.353 --> 22:37.481
- It just hit me.
- What?

22:38.106 --> 22:41.025
- That woman.
- What woman?

22:41.026 --> 22:43.403
The one whose house burned down.

22:44.112 --> 22:46.364
I knew I'd seen her somewhere.

22:46.365 --> 22:51.243
- It's the naked woman from last night.
- What?

22:51.244 --> 22:55.791
The woman who was
standing here last night.

23:02.798 --> 23:04.674
Crazy fools.

23:46.508 --> 23:50.261
They didn't burn to death.
They were stabbed.

23:50.262 --> 23:52.472
- All three of them?
- Yeah.

23:54.015 --> 23:55.892
Freaked the hell out of me, too.

23:58.145 --> 24:03.066
Prime suspect is the missus
who hung herself.

24:07.028 --> 24:10.699
What the heck happened?

24:12.200 --> 24:13.869
Beats me.

24:15.245 --> 24:16.246
Over here.

24:17.873 --> 24:19.583
- In here!
- What?

24:20.083 --> 24:22.252
Give us a hand.

24:24.546 --> 24:25.714
A little more.

24:31.261 --> 24:32.721
Found it.

24:33.972 --> 24:36.850
Idiot, don't touch it with your bare hand.

24:39.060 --> 24:40.269
What the...

24:40.270 --> 24:42.898
Are you a moron?

24:44.107 --> 24:46.025
That's evidence.

24:46.026 --> 24:50.489
He should've wrapped it in cloth
or something, right?

24:56.203 --> 24:59.706
GOKSEONG POLICE STATION

25:09.090 --> 25:12.510
So, she killed everyone?

25:12.511 --> 25:13.970
That's what they said.

25:16.389 --> 25:19.016
I'll be damned.

25:19.017 --> 25:21.060
So, that's what happened.

25:21.061 --> 25:23.897
Why did you call me?
Things are crazy at work.

25:24.523 --> 25:26.149
Because of this case.

25:29.444 --> 25:32.572
Remember what I told you before?

25:33.156 --> 25:34.156
What?

25:34.157 --> 25:37.118
How the Jap raped a woman?

25:38.036 --> 25:39.079
What about it?

25:51.591 --> 25:54.553
You filthy slut.

25:58.431 --> 25:59.599
That woman.

26:01.184 --> 26:04.979
- It was her.
- What the hell are you talking about?

26:04.980 --> 26:09.568
The woman he raped is the same woman
whose house burned down.

26:16.283 --> 26:19.410
She went crazy after that,

26:19.411 --> 26:22.372
and used to run around naked at night.

26:23.665 --> 26:26.376
My wife saw her at the public bathhouse.

26:27.043 --> 26:30.796
She was completely covered
in rashes and boils.

26:30.797 --> 26:35.302
Mumbling gibberish the whole time.

26:39.598 --> 26:41.391
Are you out of your mind?

26:42.517 --> 26:44.686
Byeong-gyu's got to stop that.

26:45.312 --> 26:47.896
Talking crap to his gullible buddies.

26:47.897 --> 26:52.151
You worthless bastard,
it was your theory in the first place.

26:52.152 --> 26:54.988
I was just messing with you.

26:55.572 --> 26:59.283
Who in their right mind
would believe crap like that?

26:59.284 --> 27:03.538
No, I think you're right.

27:04.039 --> 27:06.498
Can't be the mushrooms,
that doesn't make sense.

27:06.499 --> 27:08.585
Gimme a break!

27:13.548 --> 27:15.216
What are you looking at?

27:22.724 --> 27:24.100
Get outta here!

27:26.811 --> 27:28.229
What?

27:29.189 --> 27:31.858
Ignore her.
She's been doing that all morning.

27:32.942 --> 27:34.444
What a nutjob.

27:36.363 --> 27:40.824
So, how about you check
with the local dermatologist?

27:40.825 --> 27:44.079
See if there's a medical record
on Heung-guk or that woman.

27:46.748 --> 27:48.540
Stop it, you tramp!

27:48.541 --> 27:50.292
I can't believe this.

27:50.293 --> 27:53.671
It's important, you idiot.

27:53.672 --> 27:55.297
The rash.

27:55.298 --> 27:58.510
The rash is the link here.
I'm telling you.

28:01.096 --> 28:03.306
Come on, hurry.

28:14.442 --> 28:17.027
Stop it, you could hurt someone!

28:17.028 --> 28:21.491
COMMUNITY HEALTH CENTER

28:23.159 --> 28:24.411
Oh, my.

28:38.633 --> 28:43.138
You're really getting on my nerves!

28:47.851 --> 28:49.060
Where do you live?

28:51.229 --> 28:52.814
Are you from this village?

29:02.323 --> 29:03.324
What the hell?

29:04.743 --> 29:05.869
Stop right there.

29:09.456 --> 29:10.665
Damn it!

29:17.672 --> 29:21.092
- That lady killed them all.
- What?

29:21.676 --> 29:25.388
In there.
She killed them all in that room.

29:30.477 --> 29:32.019
What do you mean?

29:32.020 --> 29:35.022
The old woman told her
she would die if she did nothing.

29:35.023 --> 29:37.567
So a shaman did a ritual.

29:38.818 --> 29:40.487
But the lady refused.

29:42.280 --> 29:43.990
That's why she killed them all.

29:47.285 --> 29:48.870
Are you a family member?

29:51.122 --> 29:53.833
- I'm not.
- Then who are you?

29:55.627 --> 29:58.087
- Come with me.
- Hey!

29:59.714 --> 30:00.715
What the...

30:04.427 --> 30:06.304
You can't go in there.

30:07.013 --> 30:08.014
It's all right.

30:09.641 --> 30:11.017
Hey...

30:15.605 --> 30:16.606
Come on.

30:26.741 --> 30:28.618
The lady killed them here.

30:30.203 --> 30:32.080
The old woman got it the worst.

30:33.164 --> 30:36.835
Her head was smashed open
like a watermelon.

30:39.462 --> 30:41.256
You saw it with your own eyes?

30:42.841 --> 30:44.008
Yeah.

30:44.676 --> 30:46.970
- I did.
- How?

30:50.223 --> 30:54.310
The old woman tells me...
the Jap is a ghost.

30:55.854 --> 30:59.691
He was gonna suck her blood dry.

31:04.571 --> 31:06.197
- The Jap?
- Yeah.

31:06.865 --> 31:08.408
The Jap with the limp.

31:12.662 --> 31:13.955
You seen him?

31:14.747 --> 31:15.747
Yeah.

31:15.748 --> 31:19.002
- How many times?
- Once or twice.

31:19.711 --> 31:22.088
- Be careful.
- Why?

31:22.672 --> 31:27.093
The old woman says
if you keep seeing him around,

31:27.594 --> 31:30.597
it's because he's stalking you.

31:31.848 --> 31:33.725
To suck your blood dry.

31:41.858 --> 31:43.651
Wait here for just a sec.

31:44.235 --> 31:45.445
Okay.

31:51.242 --> 31:53.036
- Get your ass over here.
- What?

31:53.536 --> 31:54.954
Get over here now.

31:56.539 --> 31:58.582
But I just found the dermatologist.

31:58.583 --> 32:00.752
I found a witness. A witness.

32:01.502 --> 32:03.963
So get over here as fast as you can.

32:14.682 --> 32:15.683
What the...

32:18.269 --> 32:19.479
Where'd she go?

33:18.037 --> 33:21.749
What terrible sin did you commit
to yell like that?

33:23.126 --> 33:24.544
Are you feeling sick?

33:26.212 --> 33:29.048
I keep having weird dreams.

33:32.218 --> 33:33.802
Who's the medicine for?

33:33.803 --> 33:36.556
Hyo-jin's not feeling well.
She couldn't go to school.

33:43.312 --> 33:46.065
She's burning up.

33:48.568 --> 33:51.571
Where have you been while she was so sick?

33:52.155 --> 33:53.530
I was getting her medicine.

33:53.531 --> 33:56.242
What's with you? Take her to the hospital.

34:10.465 --> 34:12.008
What on earth was that?

34:18.389 --> 34:21.768
Turn off the hose first. Moron!

34:24.020 --> 34:25.229
Wow.

34:26.439 --> 34:28.106
Now you show up to work?

34:28.107 --> 34:32.778
Well... Hyo-jin wasn't feeling well.

34:32.779 --> 34:36.490
- Now your daughter's an excuse?
- I'm not making it up.

34:36.491 --> 34:39.826
- Did you find your witness?
- No, sir.

34:39.827 --> 34:44.289
You turned the whole town upside down.
You think this case will be your break?

34:44.290 --> 34:48.335
Seong-bok's been calling around.

34:48.336 --> 34:51.421
That's your excuse?

34:51.422 --> 34:55.593
Look at him. He can't even wash the car.

34:56.177 --> 34:57.677
You're driving me up the wall.

34:57.678 --> 35:00.681
Even the chief heard about your witness.

35:01.307 --> 35:04.769
Whether you lied or let her get away,

35:05.937 --> 35:07.396
you're screwed either way.

35:08.523 --> 35:09.524
Yes, sir.

35:12.318 --> 35:16.154
Damn, this is so frustrating.

35:16.155 --> 35:19.534
Why the hell did you listen
to that crazy girl?

35:22.662 --> 35:25.998
Not her. I'm talking about this here.

35:28.126 --> 35:30.252
WILD MUSHROOMS KILL FAMILY

35:30.253 --> 35:32.922
"Wild mushrooms kill family"?

35:33.673 --> 35:36.342
What did the dermatologist say?
Was it the mushrooms?

35:36.884 --> 35:40.762
He wasn't sure, so he referred
Heung-guk to the hospital.

35:40.763 --> 35:44.100
Told you. It can't be the mushrooms.

35:45.268 --> 35:46.644
It's not impossible.

35:47.186 --> 35:48.521
Shut your hole.

35:53.359 --> 35:57.155
You know that story
that Byeong-gyu told you?

35:57.655 --> 35:59.072
He told me more than one.

35:59.073 --> 36:02.534
The one about the naked man
eating the deer carcass.

36:02.535 --> 36:04.078
What's gotten into you?

36:04.662 --> 36:06.788
At a crazy time like this?

36:06.789 --> 36:09.292
It's because things are so crazy.

36:11.127 --> 36:13.379
You know the guy who witnessed it, right?

36:17.633 --> 36:19.509
HERBS & TONIC

36:19.510 --> 36:20.595
Over here.

36:23.514 --> 36:25.600
You may not believe it,

36:26.601 --> 36:29.478
but I saw it with my own eyes.

36:30.813 --> 36:31.939
Look at this.

36:32.523 --> 36:33.524
Can you see it?

36:35.067 --> 36:36.526
Sure.

36:36.527 --> 36:39.572
I got 22 stitches.

36:40.531 --> 36:43.701
It wasn't because you got drunk
and fell on your head?

36:44.327 --> 36:46.453
What are you talking about?

36:46.454 --> 36:50.290
I'm too old to be making shit up.

36:50.291 --> 36:52.125
You got proof?

36:52.126 --> 36:55.462
Proof? Hell, yeah!

36:55.463 --> 36:58.466
I'm not the kind to talk shit
without backing it up.

37:02.053 --> 37:03.512
Come look at this.

37:04.347 --> 37:06.474
Don't be too shocked. Here it is.

37:07.850 --> 37:08.893
Look.

37:12.230 --> 37:14.607
You see? Empty, right?

37:15.441 --> 37:19.362
I stayed the hell away from the mountains
ever since that day.

37:19.987 --> 37:22.364
Even put the store up for sale.

37:22.365 --> 37:24.033
How is that proof?

37:25.660 --> 37:26.661
What?

37:27.870 --> 37:29.747
Damn you.

37:30.373 --> 37:32.166
That's not the point.

37:33.042 --> 37:35.711
The point is, when I woke up
and opened my eyes,

37:36.379 --> 37:40.882
there he was, naked like an animal,
except he had a diaper.

37:40.883 --> 37:42.802
- A diaper?
- That's right.

37:43.386 --> 37:45.428
- A grown man?
- I'm telling you.

37:45.429 --> 37:47.889
- Grown men can wear diapers.
- Nonsense.

37:47.890 --> 37:50.976
Plenty of elderly folks wear diapers
because of bladder problems.

37:50.977 --> 37:53.728
He climbed a mountain at dawn
because of his bladder problems?

37:53.729 --> 37:54.813
Bladder problems--

37:54.814 --> 37:58.651
What the fuck is this meeting for
if you're not even going to listen?

38:00.111 --> 38:04.572
Anyway,
he had his face buried in the carcass,

38:04.573 --> 38:09.494
his body covered in blood
and eyes all bloodshot.

38:09.495 --> 38:13.124
Then, he looked at me
with his blood-red eyes,

38:14.208 --> 38:15.626
and all of a sudden...

38:20.423 --> 38:22.967
I haven't slept since that day.

38:24.010 --> 38:27.178
- Since you saw him eat the deer?
- That's right.

38:27.179 --> 38:30.641
- You saw him eat raw flesh?
- Sure did.

38:31.309 --> 38:34.353
Wait, look here.

38:35.229 --> 38:37.315
You see these goose bumps?

38:39.358 --> 38:42.028
Why the fuck are you laughing?

38:42.611 --> 38:44.279
Where does that guy live?

38:44.280 --> 38:46.990
- Why, you're gonna go?
- I think I should.

38:46.991 --> 38:49.160
Don't, you'll regret it.

38:50.828 --> 38:53.122
This is just my suspicion, but--

38:54.165 --> 38:57.209
You know how the villagers
have been dying out recently?

38:57.710 --> 38:59.837
He's got something to do with it.

39:01.380 --> 39:03.090
He's not human.

39:04.467 --> 39:06.509
Give me his address.

39:06.510 --> 39:08.303
He lives in the middle of nowhere.

39:08.304 --> 39:11.097
You have an idea of where he lives, right?

39:11.098 --> 39:14.059
It's hard to explain in words.

39:14.060 --> 39:16.395
It's deep in the valley somewhere.

39:40.669 --> 39:42.296
How much farther is it?

39:43.172 --> 39:44.423
Long way to go.

40:15.746 --> 40:16.831
Shit!

40:23.754 --> 40:24.922
What's the matter?

40:26.507 --> 40:27.550
It's there.

40:28.426 --> 40:30.886
- Over there.
- I don't see a house.

40:31.637 --> 40:33.013
Look.

40:33.764 --> 40:34.974
Right over there.

40:37.143 --> 40:38.227
Isn't that a deer?

40:40.521 --> 40:42.189
So, you weren't making it up?

40:43.149 --> 40:46.110
What have I been telling you?

40:48.654 --> 40:49.989
Oh, fuck.

40:50.531 --> 40:52.032
What's happening?

40:55.286 --> 40:57.705
- Scared me.
- What you said.

41:00.291 --> 41:01.876
What's going on?

41:05.254 --> 41:06.338
You're good, right?

41:07.339 --> 41:10.216
We're not good.
You gotta show us the house.

41:10.217 --> 41:12.802
It's just over that hill.

41:12.803 --> 41:15.723
There's only one house. You can't miss it.

41:16.307 --> 41:20.268
You came all the way here.
Take us to the house.

41:20.269 --> 41:22.145
Don't touch me. I gotta go!

41:22.146 --> 41:25.440
Where do you think you're going?

41:25.441 --> 41:27.485
I said let go!

41:33.032 --> 41:34.241
Shit.

41:37.912 --> 41:41.373
Hey! Mister. Mister?

41:44.251 --> 41:45.753
- Mister?
- Are you all right?

41:50.883 --> 41:52.760
You fucking bastards.

41:54.261 --> 41:57.681
- We're sorry.
- Fuck off.

41:58.849 --> 42:04.271
I'm gonna get your asses sacked.
You just wait.

42:04.897 --> 42:06.398
We're really sorry, okay?

42:06.899 --> 42:07.942
Fuck you!

42:08.984 --> 42:11.403
You deserve to be struck by lightning.

42:36.220 --> 42:37.304
Where are you going?

42:38.639 --> 42:40.140
You just got hit by lightning.

42:40.808 --> 42:42.142
Oh, no!

42:57.116 --> 43:00.202
What's the point of taking
all that health tonic...

43:03.247 --> 43:05.332
if you're gonna get killed by lightning?

43:09.461 --> 43:13.424
How can something like this happen?

43:17.011 --> 43:20.431
Some people never get struck,
even if they try!

43:23.350 --> 43:28.355
But they say, thanks to all that tonic,

43:29.273 --> 43:30.858
he survived.

43:33.527 --> 43:37.113
Nurse! Nurse!

43:37.114 --> 43:39.032
It's Park Heung-guk in 302!

43:39.033 --> 43:41.493
You gotta come now. It's Park Heung-guk!

43:48.626 --> 43:50.169
It's an emergency!

44:03.682 --> 44:05.768
Doctor!

44:23.535 --> 44:24.995
What's going on?

45:17.131 --> 45:18.632
Can anybody make sense...

45:20.801 --> 45:22.428
of what's happening here?

45:32.146 --> 45:34.273
Let's go back to the Jap's house tomorrow.

45:39.403 --> 45:42.614
There's definitely something
going on there. Definitely.

46:20.611 --> 46:21.820
Hyo-jin?

46:23.322 --> 46:26.157
Hyo-jin. Baby!

46:26.158 --> 46:27.492
Baby!

46:27.493 --> 46:30.453
Daddy's right here.
Daddy's right here, sweetie.

46:30.454 --> 46:32.623
Look at Daddy.

46:33.207 --> 46:35.083
Look at Daddy. Hyo-jin!

46:35.667 --> 46:37.336
Open your eyes. Open your eyes!

46:37.878 --> 46:38.879
Hyo-jin!

46:39.463 --> 46:40.506
Look at me.

46:41.340 --> 46:42.382
Look at Daddy.

46:44.384 --> 46:46.428
- Daddy's here.
- Dad!

46:52.059 --> 46:56.396
- I'm right here.
- Do something, Daddy!

46:57.731 --> 46:59.525
What, sweetie?

47:01.068 --> 47:04.529
Someone keeps banging on the door,

47:04.530 --> 47:07.241
trying to get in.

47:08.909 --> 47:09.910
Who?

47:10.494 --> 47:14.706
A strange man is trying to come in.

47:20.420 --> 47:22.089
It's okay. It's okay.

47:44.236 --> 47:45.237
Hyo-jin.

47:50.534 --> 47:51.535
Hyo-jin?

47:55.664 --> 47:56.665
What's this?

47:59.793 --> 48:01.044
You're all right?

48:03.630 --> 48:04.965
Morning, Dad.

48:14.641 --> 48:18.185
She's eating fish. She never eats fish.

48:18.186 --> 48:19.855
Something's wrong with her.

48:20.814 --> 48:24.443
I overheard what Hyo-jin said
to you last night.

48:25.777 --> 48:29.990
I asked the old lady next door
to recommend a good shaman.

48:30.490 --> 48:33.493
I'm gonna consult with him,
just letting you know.

48:34.328 --> 48:35.329
Got that?

48:39.666 --> 48:41.752
Okay. Got it.

48:42.586 --> 48:43.629
Good.

49:05.400 --> 49:06.944
- Hey.
- Hey.

49:09.196 --> 49:11.198
Say hello. This is my nephew.

49:16.119 --> 49:17.286
What is he, a priest?

49:17.287 --> 49:20.666
Not yet, he's in training.
He's just a deacon.

49:22.417 --> 49:25.629
I realized we can't communicate
with that man anyway.

49:29.716 --> 49:30.801
You speak Japanese?

49:31.718 --> 49:33.219
A little, just a little.

49:33.220 --> 49:35.304
He lived in Japan when he was young.

49:35.305 --> 49:38.266
- What's that on your neck?
- Nothing.

49:38.850 --> 49:41.812
You gotta be kidding me.

49:43.230 --> 49:45.816
- What's your name, son?
- Yang E-sam.

49:48.110 --> 49:50.195
- Is that your real name?
- Yes, sir.

49:51.196 --> 49:52.280
Let's go. Get in.

50:32.112 --> 50:34.906
Anybody home? Anyone?

50:53.467 --> 50:54.634
What is it?

51:16.573 --> 51:18.492
Goddamn perv.

51:25.082 --> 51:27.375
Look at this. What does it say?

51:29.669 --> 51:33.589
- Uncle, this is illegal.
- I know.

51:33.590 --> 51:36.425
Then why... We should stop.

51:36.426 --> 51:37.802
Get out if you won't help.

51:37.803 --> 51:40.097
- But, Uncle!
- Okay, you wait outside.

51:55.529 --> 51:57.697
What are you staring at? Don't be awkward.

52:00.534 --> 52:02.494
Go keep a lookout.

52:46.580 --> 52:47.747
What the fuck?

53:27.037 --> 53:30.039
- Son of a bitch!
- Get over here!

53:30.040 --> 53:32.042
Get him off of me!

54:02.072 --> 54:04.407
What were you doing
poking around the doghouse?

54:26.721 --> 54:28.931
Block the door! Block the door!

54:28.932 --> 54:31.226
What are you doing? Block the door!

54:33.186 --> 54:34.437
Shit!

54:35.021 --> 54:36.690
Seong-bok, you bastard!

54:39.401 --> 54:41.111
Fucking bastard!

54:44.531 --> 54:45.740
Where is it?

54:46.366 --> 54:48.868
- Where did it go?
- Over there.

54:54.833 --> 54:55.834
Seong-bok.

54:56.960 --> 54:58.420
I think it's the owner.

55:06.845 --> 55:07.846
Seong-bok?

56:14.120 --> 56:15.372
We're sorry.

56:30.220 --> 56:32.222
- Are you all right?
- Yeah.

56:33.681 --> 56:36.226
What's the matter with you?
Did you get bitten?

56:40.897 --> 56:43.566
Say something, damn it.

56:44.609 --> 56:45.860
He's the culprit.

56:47.112 --> 56:48.738
You're scaring me, man.

56:50.073 --> 56:51.074
Snap out of it.

56:52.200 --> 56:53.868
It wasn't just one or two people.

56:54.452 --> 56:56.913
He took pictures of them
when they were alive

56:57.664 --> 56:59.499
and went back to take more

57:00.125 --> 57:02.084
after they went crazy and died.

57:02.085 --> 57:04.754
What the hell are you on about?

57:07.257 --> 57:08.590
He's the culprit.

57:08.591 --> 57:12.094
That's enough. We'll deal with it later.

57:12.095 --> 57:13.430
I'm sure of it.

57:14.556 --> 57:15.557
He...

57:18.184 --> 57:20.061
He took his victims' belongings...

57:22.063 --> 57:23.773
and did something with them.

57:27.402 --> 57:29.112
What the hell did you see?

57:32.907 --> 57:35.285
I said, what did you see?

57:39.539 --> 57:42.750
JEON HYO-JIN

57:51.551 --> 57:53.218
You're getting all wet!

57:53.219 --> 57:55.555
- Where is Hyo-jin?
- In the living room.

58:03.438 --> 58:04.439
Hyo-jin.

58:07.734 --> 58:09.109
You're home early.

58:09.110 --> 58:11.154
Did you lose a shoe?

58:11.821 --> 58:14.032
No, why?

58:23.750 --> 58:24.918
What's this then?

58:26.836 --> 58:28.129
It's not mine.

58:28.713 --> 58:32.425
- Isn't this your handwriting?
- I said it's not mine.

58:37.096 --> 58:41.059
You know about a Japanese man
living in this village?

58:45.188 --> 58:47.898
You're dripping water all over the place.

58:47.899 --> 58:51.027
Answer me. Do you know him or not?

58:55.490 --> 58:57.033
Did you meet him?

59:00.578 --> 59:01.996
Answer me right now.

59:03.164 --> 59:04.582
You're scaring her.

59:05.166 --> 59:06.292
Leave us for a sec.

59:07.627 --> 59:10.296
Come on, this is serious.

59:18.471 --> 59:21.307
Daddy is a policeman. I know if you lie.

59:23.685 --> 59:25.144
Did you meet that man?

59:32.527 --> 59:33.653
Tell me.

59:35.822 --> 59:36.947
Tell you what?

59:36.948 --> 59:40.618
Everything.
Where you met and what you did.

59:42.036 --> 59:45.038
- Why should I tell you that?
- Because it's important.

59:45.039 --> 59:46.666
What's so important?

59:47.834 --> 59:49.377
You're giving me attitude?

59:53.006 --> 59:54.716
I said, what's so important?

59:57.677 --> 01:00:01.556
What's so damn important?

01:00:02.265 --> 01:00:06.019
What the hell is so damn important?

01:00:10.023 --> 01:00:12.066
You don't even know what's important.

01:00:13.067 --> 01:00:15.528
Stop fucking grilling me. Fuck.

01:01:01.324 --> 01:01:03.493
HOMEWORK. JUMP ROPE. FUCK.

01:01:05.662 --> 01:01:06.663
FUCK.

01:01:15.213 --> 01:01:16.214
KILL. KILL. KILL.

01:01:54.168 --> 01:01:55.837
What are you doing?

01:01:59.340 --> 01:02:00.757
I thought you were sleeping.

01:02:00.758 --> 01:02:02.593
What are you doing?

01:02:06.472 --> 01:02:10.101
Pulling up your daughter's skirt
in the middle of the night?

01:02:17.692 --> 01:02:18.985
Why can't you speak?

01:02:21.863 --> 01:02:24.490
Tell me, asshole.

01:02:26.075 --> 01:02:29.369
Tell me, motherfucker!

01:02:29.370 --> 01:02:30.705
Fuck you!

01:02:35.877 --> 01:02:38.295
Stop staring, motherfucker!

01:02:38.296 --> 01:02:41.507
Don't call your daddy that!

01:02:43.509 --> 01:02:45.093
Don't you look at me!

01:02:45.094 --> 01:02:48.138
Stop it! Daddy said he was sorry.

01:02:48.139 --> 01:02:50.391
I'm gonna kill you all.

01:02:51.350 --> 01:02:52.518
How could you?

01:03:09.243 --> 01:03:11.245
I met the shaman today.

01:03:12.789 --> 01:03:14.707
He says there's an evil spirit here.

01:03:15.625 --> 01:03:18.211
It's possessed Hyo-jin.

01:03:19.420 --> 01:03:21.964
He says if we don't act,
there'll be more deaths.

01:03:23.049 --> 01:03:25.218
He's supposed to be the best.

01:03:38.231 --> 01:03:40.024
Why didn't you answer my calls?

01:03:41.943 --> 01:03:44.654
Come with me, and don't give me any crap.

01:04:59.729 --> 01:05:01.647
Ask him where he stashed the stuff.

01:05:02.857 --> 01:05:06.152
The things in there... Where now?

01:05:11.991 --> 01:05:13.200
What things?

01:05:14.368 --> 01:05:16.077
He asks what.

01:05:16.078 --> 01:05:18.122
The stuff that we saw before.

01:05:18.456 --> 01:05:21.834
Things we saw before.

01:05:22.251 --> 01:05:23.544
The photographs?

01:05:24.170 --> 01:05:27.464
- You mean the pictures?
- Yeah, the pictures, and the other stuff.

01:05:27.465 --> 01:05:28.549
Yes.

01:05:32.470 --> 01:05:33.471
I burned them.

01:05:37.224 --> 01:05:38.434
I said I burned them.

01:05:41.187 --> 01:05:42.688
He burned them.

01:05:45.191 --> 01:05:46.484
Where?

01:05:47.443 --> 01:05:49.195
Where?

01:05:50.863 --> 01:05:51.864
In the kitchen.

01:05:52.365 --> 01:05:53.699
In the kitchen.

01:06:10.591 --> 01:06:12.218
Bastard!

01:06:14.512 --> 01:06:15.513
You!

01:06:18.057 --> 01:06:19.517
What did you come here to do?

01:06:22.478 --> 01:06:25.648
What did you come here to do?

01:06:28.651 --> 01:06:29.944
Ask him again.

01:06:32.238 --> 01:06:35.032
Why are you here?

01:06:40.830 --> 01:06:41.872
To travel.

01:06:42.915 --> 01:06:44.375
To travel, he says.

01:06:45.084 --> 01:06:48.838
Tell him I'll throw him in jail
if he doesn't fess up.

01:06:51.799 --> 01:06:54.301
Be honest with us.

01:07:02.351 --> 01:07:05.186
You wouldn't believe me
even if I told you.

01:07:05.187 --> 01:07:08.149
He says you wouldn't believe him.

01:07:10.985 --> 01:07:14.238
- You interpret everything I say literally.
- Yes, sir.

01:07:14.905 --> 01:07:16.532
You fucking prick.

01:07:17.158 --> 01:07:19.951
You loose-assed,
dog-fucking son of a whore!

01:07:19.952 --> 01:07:21.161
So...

01:07:21.162 --> 01:07:24.331
What kind of tourist hangs pictures
of dead people on his wall?

01:07:25.458 --> 01:07:28.376
- Travel... The dead...
- Why was this in your house?

01:07:28.377 --> 01:07:29.627
How did this...

01:07:29.628 --> 01:07:31.796
Who the fuck are you?

01:07:31.797 --> 01:07:32.882
Who are you?

01:07:35.301 --> 01:07:39.138
I know what you're doing to this village.
I saw everything in that room.

01:07:39.722 --> 01:07:44.101
And I know what the fuck
you're doing to my daughter!

01:07:48.147 --> 01:07:49.523
I want you

01:07:50.316 --> 01:07:54.487
to stop what you're doing
and leave this village quietly.

01:07:55.237 --> 01:07:56.489
I mean it.

01:07:57.031 --> 01:07:59.825
Just leave. Quietly.

01:08:00.409 --> 01:08:03.245
This is Gokseong. My turf.

01:08:03.829 --> 01:08:08.501
Don't mess around
and get yourself killed, just leave.

01:08:08.876 --> 01:08:12.129
If you don't leave, you'll die.

01:08:15.174 --> 01:08:19.886
If you heard me, say something,
or at least nod your fucking head!

01:08:19.887 --> 01:08:21.514
Please answer.

01:08:28.145 --> 01:08:30.772
All right. I'll prove it--

01:08:30.773 --> 01:08:32.358
Shut up, bitch!

01:08:34.026 --> 01:08:37.363
You're just gonna ignore me?
I'm just not worth answering.

01:08:39.698 --> 01:08:41.700
Is that it?

01:08:44.245 --> 01:08:47.748
You're not even gonna listen, right?

01:08:48.249 --> 01:08:49.916
Ain't that right?

01:08:49.917 --> 01:08:52.627
I'm speaking to you, but you won't listen!

01:08:52.628 --> 01:08:54.421
You won't listen!

01:08:56.799 --> 01:09:02.346
What's this? What the fuck is this?
What the hell is all this?

01:09:03.347 --> 01:09:04.682
What the...

01:09:05.391 --> 01:09:08.602
What the fuck are you doing,
a freaking ritual?

01:09:11.438 --> 01:09:13.566
What the fuck are you doing in my town?

01:09:15.568 --> 01:09:19.028
You know whose daughter
you're messing with?

01:09:19.029 --> 01:09:22.575
- Son of a bitch!
- Look out!

01:10:00.446 --> 01:10:02.156
Jong-gu?

01:10:27.973 --> 01:10:29.308
Now what?

01:10:33.896 --> 01:10:35.022
Believe me now?

01:10:38.984 --> 01:10:40.569
I'll give you three days.

01:10:41.320 --> 01:10:42.988
Pack up and leave in three days.

01:10:43.572 --> 01:10:45.699
If you don't, you'll end up like your dog.

01:10:47.326 --> 01:10:48.535
Interpret that.

01:10:50.871 --> 01:10:52.539
Interpret what I said.

01:11:18.357 --> 01:11:20.067
How long has it been like this?

01:11:21.068 --> 01:11:23.028
Just a few days.

01:12:04.820 --> 01:12:06.113
So?

01:12:06.822 --> 01:12:09.616
The symptoms are the same as the others.

01:12:11.410 --> 01:12:15.205
There's gotta be
an explanation for what she has.

01:12:16.123 --> 01:12:17.499
They say they don't know.

01:12:43.317 --> 01:12:46.570
- What is it?
- Oh, God!

01:12:53.327 --> 01:12:54.953
Who the fuck did this?

01:12:58.749 --> 01:13:01.125
Honey! Honey!

01:13:01.126 --> 01:13:04.046
Get your husband.

01:13:04.797 --> 01:13:06.173
Who did this?

01:13:06.965 --> 01:13:08.550
Who the fuck did this?

01:13:09.176 --> 01:13:10.469
Jong-gu!

01:13:13.472 --> 01:13:17.101
Jong-gu! Jong-gu! Jong-gu!

01:13:25.401 --> 01:13:26.902
Does he drink a lot?

01:13:28.445 --> 01:13:30.155
It's nothing to worry about.

01:13:31.365 --> 01:13:33.367
I'll take the needles out in 20 minutes.

01:13:34.284 --> 01:13:37.996
Cut down on your drinking, if you don't
want to be paralyzed for good.

01:13:39.748 --> 01:13:41.166
Okay.

01:13:45.087 --> 01:13:46.964
It's begun.

01:13:47.631 --> 01:13:49.591
You better brace yourself.

01:13:51.760 --> 01:13:55.347
The thing we discussed the other day,
we'll do it tomorrow.

01:13:56.598 --> 01:13:57.974
Where is Hyo-jin?

01:13:57.975 --> 01:14:01.936
You can't back out now.
Get the money for the ritual.

01:14:01.937 --> 01:14:05.398
- Where is she?
- At home. Where else would she be?

01:14:05.399 --> 01:14:08.025
I asked the old lady next door
to watch her.

01:14:08.026 --> 01:14:09.862
You left her alone with a stranger?

01:14:11.280 --> 01:14:13.197
Are you out of your minds?

01:14:13.198 --> 01:14:14.658
Don't move.

01:14:18.954 --> 01:14:19.955
Baby.

01:14:20.539 --> 01:14:21.540
Hyo-jin.

01:14:22.249 --> 01:14:23.250
Baby.

01:14:24.668 --> 01:14:25.919
Baby!

01:14:33.510 --> 01:14:35.554
- What's the matter?
- Oh, my God!

01:14:38.265 --> 01:14:40.809
Hyo-jin! Hyo-jin!

01:14:41.393 --> 01:14:42.852
Hyo-jin! Hyo-jin!

01:14:42.853 --> 01:14:45.355
What's this? Drop that, baby.

01:14:46.565 --> 01:14:49.151
Don't cry. It's okay.

01:14:49.860 --> 01:14:52.070
It's okay. It'll be okay!

01:14:56.658 --> 01:14:57.826
Call 911! Quick!

01:15:26.021 --> 01:15:28.065
This is all the work of that Jap.

01:15:30.609 --> 01:15:32.361
Ever since we went to his house,

01:15:33.320 --> 01:15:34.863
my body's been in pain.

01:15:35.822 --> 01:15:37.991
I have bad fevers and I'm seeing things.

01:15:40.452 --> 01:15:43.205
A man's face pops out of the wall.

01:15:44.873 --> 01:15:46.500
I don't think it's a living man.

01:15:50.712 --> 01:15:52.130
We gotta do something.

01:15:53.632 --> 01:15:57.761
Or the bastard will get us first.

01:17:01.033 --> 01:17:03.118
Shut the damn door!

01:17:57.714 --> 01:17:59.091
What's in that jar?

01:17:59.925 --> 01:18:01.676
Which one?

01:18:01.677 --> 01:18:03.969
The one with a red lid.

01:18:03.970 --> 01:18:06.390
It's just soy sauce.

01:18:08.558 --> 01:18:10.435
Bring it over.

01:18:13.647 --> 01:18:15.732
What, are you deaf?

01:18:23.782 --> 01:18:26.118
Out of the way, come on.

01:18:29.871 --> 01:18:30.872
Stand back.

01:18:43.093 --> 01:18:44.218
What is that?

01:18:44.219 --> 01:18:46.972
Fucking hell.

01:18:50.559 --> 01:18:53.645
It's a real wicked spirit we've got here.

01:19:18.336 --> 01:19:21.715
You don't want to leave, do you?

01:19:37.355 --> 01:19:38.440
Let's go!

01:19:59.461 --> 01:20:00.921
Stop it!

01:20:33.995 --> 01:20:35.038
Hyo-jin!

01:20:43.088 --> 01:20:44.464
Come here, you!

01:21:08.280 --> 01:21:11.908
Did you recently meet something
you weren't supposed to?

01:21:16.997 --> 01:21:19.875
What do you mean?

01:21:23.003 --> 01:21:25.922
Did you disturb someone?

01:21:29.050 --> 01:21:34.973
Of all the evil I've seen,
this is the strongest.

01:21:35.765 --> 01:21:38.142
You disturbed it.

01:21:38.143 --> 01:21:41.438
Oh, God. What can we do now?

01:21:42.147 --> 01:21:43.523
Who is it?

01:21:47.444 --> 01:21:51.072
- Who did you disturb?
- Tell him.

01:21:58.246 --> 01:21:59.956
A Japanese man.

01:22:05.879 --> 01:22:07.589
I knew it.

01:22:09.257 --> 01:22:12.469
That's no man.

01:22:14.638 --> 01:22:16.473
That's a ghost.

01:22:38.703 --> 01:22:43.291
All the things that happened
around here are his doing.

01:22:46.628 --> 01:22:50.298
If nothing is done about it,
not just your daughter

01:22:51.007 --> 01:22:55.011
but everything that walks
on two feet will perish.

01:23:02.018 --> 01:23:03.310
Sir.

01:23:03.311 --> 01:23:06.439
This is Park Chun-bae,
the owner of this house.

01:23:09.150 --> 01:23:12.444
- He killed his wife, too?
- It appears so.

01:23:12.445 --> 01:23:14.822
What's that bastard's name?

01:23:14.823 --> 01:23:16.825
Park Chun-bae.

01:23:18.910 --> 01:23:19.910
Then what?

01:23:19.911 --> 01:23:23.665
What do you mean, what?
Gotta get rid of it.

01:23:25.750 --> 01:23:29.045
Either banish it, or kill it.

01:23:40.223 --> 01:23:44.227
I'm going to cast a deadly hex
at dog hour tomorrow.

01:23:47.856 --> 01:23:50.858
- Yes, sir.
- You got the money?

01:23:50.859 --> 01:23:52.526
How much?

01:23:52.527 --> 01:23:54.738
It would have to be about ten million won.

01:23:57.866 --> 01:23:59.576
I'll have it ready.

01:24:00.368 --> 01:24:01.703
Good.

01:24:08.293 --> 01:24:09.753
Listen.

01:24:10.420 --> 01:24:12.505
What I'm going to do tomorrow

01:24:13.798 --> 01:24:15.550
is no ordinary ritual.

01:24:16.176 --> 01:24:18.219
I'll be casting a deadly hex.

01:24:19.345 --> 01:24:21.097
It's incredibly dangerous.

01:24:21.639 --> 01:24:24.392
So, don't do anything that could taint it.

01:24:25.977 --> 01:24:30.690
No intercourse.
Watch what you eat and drink.

01:24:32.692 --> 01:24:34.861
Or the spell will backfire.

01:24:35.653 --> 01:24:36.696
Yes, sir.

01:24:37.822 --> 01:24:40.408
Okay, then, you can go.

01:24:49.626 --> 01:24:52.754
Can I ask you something?

01:24:54.589 --> 01:24:55.673
What?

01:24:56.591 --> 01:24:59.302
That Japanese guy.

01:25:00.595 --> 01:25:03.264
You said he's a ghost.

01:25:04.099 --> 01:25:05.099
So?

01:25:05.100 --> 01:25:10.146
I don't get how a living human
can be a ghost.

01:25:15.610 --> 01:25:17.237
That's no living human.

01:25:24.452 --> 01:25:26.121
He died a long time ago.

01:25:29.040 --> 01:25:31.126
He must have been human once.

01:25:32.335 --> 01:25:33.753
But not anymore.

01:25:37.674 --> 01:25:38.716
So then,

01:25:39.843 --> 01:25:42.804
the ghost entered inside him?

01:25:43.429 --> 01:25:45.473
Well, that's how it started.

01:25:50.895 --> 01:25:54.983
Not everything that moves,
breathes and talks is living.

01:25:56.359 --> 01:25:59.571
Countless people have perished
because they didn't realize that.

01:26:02.073 --> 01:26:03.741
If it's not stopped,

01:26:04.742 --> 01:26:09.706
that demon will destroy this village.

01:26:10.290 --> 01:26:11.790
Demon?

01:26:11.791 --> 01:26:14.084
An evil spirit.

01:26:14.085 --> 01:26:17.714
Even among demons,
he's a high-ranking spirit.

01:26:24.596 --> 01:26:26.013
Well, then,

01:26:26.014 --> 01:26:29.933
why... why did it have to be--

01:26:29.934 --> 01:26:31.394
Why your daughter?

01:26:31.936 --> 01:26:34.606
What sin did that young girl ever commit?

01:26:35.607 --> 01:26:36.733
Yes.

01:26:38.067 --> 01:26:43.448
If you go fishing,
do you know what you'll catch?

01:26:44.616 --> 01:26:45.742
No.

01:26:47.452 --> 01:26:49.787
He's just fishing.

01:26:51.039 --> 01:26:54.292
Not even he knows what he'll catch.

01:26:55.418 --> 01:27:02.217
He just threw out the bait,
and your daughter bit it.

01:27:05.345 --> 01:27:06.971
That's all it is.

01:27:15.313 --> 01:27:17.440
PARK CHUN-BAE

01:27:36.834 --> 01:27:39.545
- This one?
- Not that one.

01:27:41.547 --> 01:27:43.549
Money. Yes, money.

01:27:44.133 --> 01:27:46.385
21,000 won more.

01:27:46.386 --> 01:27:48.805
- I said no!
- That's okay.

01:27:49.764 --> 01:27:51.140
What a weirdo.

01:31:23.728 --> 01:31:25.188
Tell him to stop.

01:32:04.352 --> 01:32:05.645
Stop!

01:32:06.979 --> 01:32:08.898
Stop!

01:32:11.692 --> 01:32:13.444
I said stop!

01:32:51.899 --> 01:32:55.611
Jong-gu! Jong-gu! Jong-gu!

01:33:03.744 --> 01:33:04.870
What's the matter?

01:33:51.083 --> 01:33:52.084
Look at me.

01:34:23.240 --> 01:34:24.700
Baby?

01:34:25.618 --> 01:34:26.994
Baby?

01:35:06.242 --> 01:35:07.284
Hyo-jin!

01:35:44.655 --> 01:35:45.990
Please make him stop.

01:35:47.700 --> 01:35:48.826
Please...

01:35:51.829 --> 01:35:53.372
Please make him stop!

01:36:19.106 --> 01:36:20.357
Dad!

01:36:24.612 --> 01:36:25.821
Dad...

01:36:26.405 --> 01:36:27.530
Hyo-jin.

01:36:27.531 --> 01:36:28.699
What's the matter?

01:36:36.373 --> 01:36:38.501
Stop, you bastards!

01:36:40.127 --> 01:36:44.006
Stop! Fucking bastards!

01:36:44.632 --> 01:36:46.884
Stop right now!

01:36:48.385 --> 01:36:49.553
Stop!

01:36:50.429 --> 01:36:52.555
Stop!

01:36:52.556 --> 01:36:54.808
I said stop!

01:36:54.809 --> 01:36:55.892
Stop.

01:36:55.893 --> 01:36:58.604
I'm gonna smash your heads in!

01:36:59.647 --> 01:37:01.148
Stop, I said.

01:37:01.816 --> 01:37:02.817
Get out.

01:37:03.734 --> 01:37:05.194
Get out!

01:38:26.942 --> 01:38:29.904
It all started from that day?

01:38:39.288 --> 01:38:42.124
I'll try speaking to the priest.

01:38:45.878 --> 01:38:49.882
Is what you're telling me true?

01:38:51.133 --> 01:38:52.426
Yes.

01:38:58.766 --> 01:39:02.561
You said the shaman told you this.

01:39:03.062 --> 01:39:05.939
From their perspective,

01:39:05.940 --> 01:39:10.152
a ghost is the spirit of a dead man.

01:39:11.528 --> 01:39:13.864
But that man is alive.

01:39:15.532 --> 01:39:19.036
I've heard about this man, too.

01:39:19.870 --> 01:39:22.789
Rumor has it he is a renowned professor.

01:39:22.790 --> 01:39:25.084
Some darker, disturbing rumors, too.

01:39:25.793 --> 01:39:27.962
Others say he's a Buddhist monk.

01:39:28.587 --> 01:39:33.466
But they're just rumors.
How can you believe them?

01:39:33.467 --> 01:39:37.388
No, Father. They're definitely not rumors.

01:39:38.806 --> 01:39:41.475
You sound terribly sure.

01:39:45.062 --> 01:39:47.690
Did you see it with your own eyes?

01:39:50.067 --> 01:39:54.113
How can you be sure
without seeing it for yourself?

01:39:55.823 --> 01:39:59.618
Take her back to the hospital.
Trust the doctor.

01:40:00.536 --> 01:40:02.371
Leave her to him.

01:40:03.330 --> 01:40:05.958
There's nothing the Church can do for you.

01:40:12.089 --> 01:40:14.091
Come with me to the Jap's.

01:40:14.967 --> 01:40:16.010
Sorry?

01:40:16.593 --> 01:40:21.724
I gotta see for myself,
whether he really is a ghost or not.

01:40:24.768 --> 01:40:26.228
If he is...

01:40:28.272 --> 01:40:30.107
then I won't be able to kill him.

01:41:05.434 --> 01:41:07.061
Where is he?

01:41:07.561 --> 01:41:09.395
- Is everyone here?
- Yeah.

01:41:09.396 --> 01:41:11.564
What's going on so early in the morning?

01:41:11.565 --> 01:41:14.026
Cheol-yeong couldn't come.
His sow is farrowing.

01:41:16.612 --> 01:41:17.738
What's with your face?

01:41:36.298 --> 01:41:40.052
You're not playing around, are you?

01:41:43.847 --> 01:41:45.307
You're serious, right?

01:41:46.725 --> 01:41:47.725
Yeah.

01:41:47.726 --> 01:41:49.812
Cross your heart, or your mom's a whore?

01:41:50.562 --> 01:41:52.189
You prick!

01:41:53.565 --> 01:41:56.735
- This is no time for jokes.
- You fucking loser.

01:42:07.704 --> 01:42:09.039
Go!

01:42:29.184 --> 01:42:30.435
- Nothing?
- No.

01:42:31.061 --> 01:42:33.272
Don't just stand around. Check the back.

01:43:20.569 --> 01:43:21.653
What's that?

01:43:23.197 --> 01:43:25.907
Fucking bastard.

01:43:25.908 --> 01:43:28.994
Byeong-gyu! Over here!

01:43:29.995 --> 01:43:33.206
Byeong-gyu! Hurry up!

01:43:33.207 --> 01:43:35.374
- Is that him?
- Over there.

01:43:35.375 --> 01:43:36.877
Where? Follow me.

01:43:37.502 --> 01:43:38.629
Where?

01:43:45.761 --> 01:43:46.970
What the...

01:43:47.804 --> 01:43:49.139
Who's that?

01:43:51.308 --> 01:43:54.144
What is that thing?

01:43:56.647 --> 01:43:58.815
Don't come any closer. Back off.

01:44:16.833 --> 01:44:17.834
Back off.

01:44:22.756 --> 01:44:23.965
Stop it.

01:44:23.966 --> 01:44:26.677
That's enough, man!

01:44:28.345 --> 01:44:31.682
Sorry, man. Are you all right?

01:44:39.064 --> 01:44:40.982
Stop it!

01:44:40.983 --> 01:44:43.317
What are you doing to him?

01:44:43.318 --> 01:44:46.320
- Something's wrong.
- Put it down.

01:44:46.321 --> 01:44:48.698
- Let go!
- We can talk this out.

01:44:48.699 --> 01:44:49.908
E-sam!

01:47:08.547 --> 01:47:09.881
Dad!

01:47:11.341 --> 01:47:13.885
Look.

01:47:15.846 --> 01:47:17.222
There's another one.

01:47:31.361 --> 01:47:32.737
That's him.

01:47:33.488 --> 01:47:34.531
That's him.

01:47:35.031 --> 01:47:36.575
Get him!

01:47:39.870 --> 01:47:41.287
Get him!

01:47:41.288 --> 01:47:42.622
Where?

01:47:44.124 --> 01:47:47.084
- Son of a bitch!
- There he is!

01:47:47.085 --> 01:47:49.045
Over there!

01:47:51.923 --> 01:47:52.924
Son of a bitch!

01:48:03.894 --> 01:48:05.186
Where is he?

01:48:05.187 --> 01:48:06.645
Over there.

01:48:06.646 --> 01:48:07.731
Where?

01:49:04.329 --> 01:49:05.330
What's wrong?

01:49:07.123 --> 01:49:10.377
- Come over here.
- Hey, why did you stop?

01:49:11.628 --> 01:49:13.004
What's the matter?

01:49:13.838 --> 01:49:15.131
Come over here!

01:49:16.675 --> 01:49:17.842
Jong-gu.

01:49:22.931 --> 01:49:25.141
Where'd he go? Where is that bastard?

01:49:27.727 --> 01:49:30.771
Hey, man! Get down here.

01:49:30.772 --> 01:49:32.356
Do you see him?

01:49:32.357 --> 01:49:34.651
- Hey!
- Where did he go?

01:49:37.070 --> 01:49:38.071
Jong-gu!

01:49:42.409 --> 01:49:43.660
I gotta catch him.

01:49:45.870 --> 01:49:47.330
Gotta catch the bastard.

01:49:49.249 --> 01:49:50.250
Catch the bastard.

01:49:54.004 --> 01:49:55.087
I can't believe this!

01:49:55.088 --> 01:49:56.964
- Gotta save my baby.
- Come on.

01:49:56.965 --> 01:49:59.258
- Let's go down.
- I gotta save my little girl.

01:49:59.259 --> 01:50:01.677
- We'll get him.
- I gotta find him to save my baby.

01:50:01.678 --> 01:50:03.179
Don't worry. We will.

01:50:05.515 --> 01:50:07.309
Get your act together, man.

01:50:07.809 --> 01:50:11.187
We gotta save her.

01:50:11.771 --> 01:50:13.189
I know, man.

01:50:14.024 --> 01:50:15.191
I know.

01:50:15.775 --> 01:50:20.405
- I have to save my daughter!
- Come on, man.

01:50:24.909 --> 01:50:29.288
I have to catch that bastard!

01:50:29.289 --> 01:50:31.207
Don't cry, man.

01:50:32.375 --> 01:50:36.421
Damn it, Jong-gu!

01:52:45.091 --> 01:52:46.300
WIFE

01:52:46.301 --> 01:52:47.594
Please, pick up.

01:53:23.463 --> 01:53:27.759
Shit! Was that a person?

01:56:06.876 --> 01:56:10.880
WIFE

01:56:19.305 --> 01:56:21.307
The little ant...

01:56:23.309 --> 01:56:25.228
fell into the trap.

01:57:19.449 --> 01:57:20.867
Are you all right, baby?

01:57:27.123 --> 01:57:28.458
You okay?

01:57:29.917 --> 01:57:31.044
I'm okay!

01:57:33.004 --> 01:57:34.005
Come here.

01:57:46.601 --> 01:57:47.643
You're okay now?

01:57:50.772 --> 01:57:52.148
You're okay now?

01:58:12.043 --> 01:58:13.461
Drink up.

01:58:14.045 --> 01:58:15.171
Good girl.

01:58:45.952 --> 01:58:47.620
Leave it.

01:58:48.121 --> 01:58:49.746
I want to tidy up a little.

01:58:49.747 --> 01:58:53.209
Leave it. We've got the shaman
to thank for everything.

01:58:54.127 --> 01:58:56.546
Get some rest. You must be exhausted.

01:59:00.091 --> 01:59:01.926
SHAMAN

01:59:09.976 --> 01:59:11.394
Damn fool.

01:59:24.782 --> 01:59:29.537
Suspect arrested
in the mushroom tonic case...

01:59:35.918 --> 01:59:39.255
Victims have developed
severe mental derangement...

01:59:45.928 --> 01:59:47.345
Mr. Yang E-sam?

01:59:47.346 --> 01:59:48.431
Yes.

01:59:53.936 --> 01:59:55.646
The victim is the landlady.

01:59:56.981 --> 01:59:58.941
Your uncle must've taken the tonic too.

01:59:59.942 --> 02:00:02.111
The town's been turned upside down.

02:00:03.821 --> 02:00:05.448
We have to arrest him.

02:00:05.948 --> 02:00:09.202
You should get him a lawyer.

02:00:10.453 --> 02:00:11.704
In a way,

02:00:13.206 --> 02:00:14.707
your uncle's a victim, too.

02:00:44.445 --> 02:00:46.447
What the fuck?

02:01:07.843 --> 02:01:09.387
What are you doing here?

02:01:26.696 --> 02:01:27.905
Get out.

02:01:49.760 --> 02:01:51.929
MISSED CALLS - SHAMAN

02:03:49.004 --> 02:03:50.840
What the hell?

02:03:54.468 --> 02:03:55.511
What the...

02:04:54.737 --> 02:04:56.614
- Hello.
- It's me.

02:04:57.448 --> 02:05:00.074
- Where are you?
- What about you?

02:05:00.075 --> 02:05:01.826
Just listen to me.

02:05:01.827 --> 02:05:04.996
You need to go to your daughter, now.

02:05:04.997 --> 02:05:07.332
Tell me. What's going on?

02:05:07.333 --> 02:05:09.250
I'm at your place now.

02:05:09.251 --> 02:05:13.713
Go back to your house now.

02:05:13.714 --> 02:05:16.967
Stop scaring me. Tell me what's wrong.

02:05:19.595 --> 02:05:20.596
I...

02:05:22.264 --> 02:05:25.935
I misread the divination.

02:05:27.269 --> 02:05:29.021
It's not him.

02:05:30.481 --> 02:05:31.857
What are you talking about?

02:05:33.442 --> 02:05:35.736
I cast the hex on the wrong ghost.

02:05:36.612 --> 02:05:38.864
I saw a woman in front of your house.

02:05:39.657 --> 02:05:43.160
I made a grave mistake.

02:05:43.786 --> 02:05:45.955
A terrible, terrible mistake.

02:05:49.124 --> 02:05:51.001
It's not the Japanese man.

02:05:51.585 --> 02:05:53.462
That woman is the evil spirit.

02:05:54.213 --> 02:05:56.130
It was all her doing.

02:05:56.131 --> 02:05:59.677
So, go home now. I'm on my way there, too.

02:06:00.636 --> 02:06:01.637
Then...

02:06:04.139 --> 02:06:05.306
who's the Japanese man?

02:06:05.307 --> 02:06:09.019
He was trying to kill that woman

02:06:10.145 --> 02:06:13.148
in order to save people from her.

02:06:13.732 --> 02:06:14.900
Understand?

02:06:15.401 --> 02:06:17.194
That Japanese man...

02:06:19.405 --> 02:06:21.073
is a shaman like me.

02:06:28.747 --> 02:06:29.915
Was the woman

02:06:30.833 --> 02:06:32.001
wearing white?

02:06:36.046 --> 02:06:37.464
Did you see her?

02:06:42.428 --> 02:06:43.679
A young woman?

02:06:45.347 --> 02:06:47.057
That's her.

02:06:55.899 --> 02:06:57.776
...defend us in battle.

02:06:59.028 --> 02:07:02.197
Be our safeguard against the wickedness

02:07:03.741 --> 02:07:05.618
and snares of evil.

02:07:26.639 --> 02:07:27.640
Where is she?

02:07:30.267 --> 02:07:31.602
Where's Hyo-jin?

02:08:27.157 --> 02:08:28.200
Hyo-jin!

02:08:38.585 --> 02:08:39.586
What is it?

02:08:43.382 --> 02:08:45.426
Where are you going at this time of night?

02:08:57.271 --> 02:08:59.022
I'm asking you.

02:09:00.274 --> 02:09:01.900
Where is my daughter?

02:09:04.528 --> 02:09:05.988
Where is she?

02:09:11.160 --> 02:09:14.121
- Girl about this tall?
- Yeah.

02:09:20.669 --> 02:09:21.670
Hyo-jin?

02:09:23.297 --> 02:09:24.339
That's right.

02:09:25.048 --> 02:09:27.676
She's possessed by an evil spirit.

02:09:28.510 --> 02:09:32.055
The old woman tells me the Jap is a ghost.

02:09:33.515 --> 02:09:36.518
- He's trying to suck her blood dry--
- Shut the fuck up!

02:09:37.644 --> 02:09:39.313
Answer me, bitch.

02:09:40.397 --> 02:09:42.149
Where is Hyo-jin?

02:09:43.484 --> 02:09:46.695
- Have you seen the Jap?
- Where's my daughter?

02:09:47.571 --> 02:09:49.781
At your house. Where else?

02:09:49.782 --> 02:09:52.367
- She's not home.
- She is.

02:09:53.827 --> 02:09:55.120
She just got back.

02:10:00.292 --> 02:10:01.668
Don't go now.

02:10:03.712 --> 02:10:08.634
Or you'll all die.
If you go now, your family perishes.

02:10:16.558 --> 02:10:17.976
What are you talking about?

02:10:40.666 --> 02:10:43.752
The Jap is waiting for you.

02:10:44.586 --> 02:10:47.756
To annihilate your family.

02:10:50.425 --> 02:10:52.260
He's dead.

02:10:52.261 --> 02:10:53.762
He's not dead.

02:10:55.889 --> 02:10:57.766
Death cannot touch him.

02:11:01.645 --> 02:11:05.524
The demon will soon enter your home.

02:11:07.776 --> 02:11:09.778
You've seen the demon?

02:11:11.989 --> 02:11:15.409
At the house of the hanged woman.

02:11:22.332 --> 02:11:25.168
- It was a dream.
- It was no dream.

02:11:58.493 --> 02:12:00.495
I laid a snare for it.

02:12:01.288 --> 02:12:03.624
Wait here until he is caught.

02:12:04.374 --> 02:12:05.959
That's all you need do.

02:12:08.670 --> 02:12:09.671
Hey.

02:12:11.798 --> 02:12:12.799
What are you?

02:12:16.970 --> 02:12:18.680
A human or a ghost?

02:12:19.348 --> 02:12:20.933
Why do you ask?

02:12:21.516 --> 02:12:26.063
I need to know...
whether I should trust you or not.

02:12:26.688 --> 02:12:30.149
Trust me, and your family will be saved.

02:12:30.150 --> 02:12:31.860
What are you?

02:12:48.377 --> 02:12:50.587
Someone trying to save your daughter.

02:12:53.674 --> 02:12:54.675
A woman.

02:12:57.511 --> 02:13:01.098
I called all of her friends,
but no one knows where she is.

02:13:06.395 --> 02:13:07.437
Hyo-jin?

02:13:08.021 --> 02:13:09.022
Hyo-jin!

02:13:12.025 --> 02:13:13.068
Baby.

02:13:13.652 --> 02:13:14.653
Baby!

02:13:29.835 --> 02:13:32.796
When will the demon come?

02:13:34.756 --> 02:13:36.091
It's already there.

02:13:47.060 --> 02:13:48.103
Hyo-jin.

02:13:49.563 --> 02:13:52.065
It's already there?

02:14:03.452 --> 02:14:04.661
Let me ask you one thing.

02:14:07.414 --> 02:14:11.668
What is your true form?

02:14:54.419 --> 02:14:56.962
What do you think I am?

02:14:56.963 --> 02:14:58.507
The devil.

02:14:59.549 --> 02:15:01.468
You are the devil.

02:15:04.971 --> 02:15:06.555
Why can't you answer me?

02:15:06.556 --> 02:15:09.309
You already said it.

02:15:11.603 --> 02:15:15.523
That I'm the devil.

02:15:15.524 --> 02:15:17.776
SHAMAN

02:15:27.410 --> 02:15:29.663
I'm almost there.
Where are you? Are you home?

02:15:30.872 --> 02:15:34.417
I'm with that woman now.

02:15:35.377 --> 02:15:39.088
You must not let her tempt you.

02:15:39.089 --> 02:15:40.256
Never.

02:15:40.257 --> 02:15:44.344
Whatever she tells you,
you must go to your daughter now.

02:15:45.011 --> 02:15:46.387
Do you understand me?

02:15:46.388 --> 02:15:47.764
Understand?

02:15:49.641 --> 02:15:51.393
Do you?

02:15:55.438 --> 02:15:56.648
Is that your shaman?

02:16:01.736 --> 02:16:03.405
Don't believe what he tells you.

02:16:04.447 --> 02:16:06.074
They're in on it together.

02:16:06.867 --> 02:16:08.118
Isn't that right?

02:16:09.703 --> 02:16:14.541
You are already certain
that I'm the devil.

02:16:15.333 --> 02:16:17.419
That's why you came here

02:16:18.128 --> 02:16:19.546
with that sickle.

02:16:29.347 --> 02:16:34.476
No matter what I tell you
about who I am with my own lips,

02:16:34.477 --> 02:16:36.896
you'll never change your mind.

02:16:36.897 --> 02:16:38.856
You're wrong.

02:16:38.857 --> 02:16:40.108
Absolutely wrong.

02:16:41.193 --> 02:16:43.068
You'd never believe me.

02:16:43.069 --> 02:16:49.825
You came here to confirm
your suspicion about me being the devil.

02:16:49.826 --> 02:16:51.411
That's not true!

02:16:53.705 --> 02:16:54.706
If you say

02:16:55.749 --> 02:16:59.544
that you're not the devil

02:17:00.170 --> 02:17:02.797
and reveal to me your true form...

02:17:05.175 --> 02:17:07.510
then I'll leave you alone.

02:17:09.512 --> 02:17:11.681
When the demon is snared,

02:17:12.974 --> 02:17:15.852
the rooster will cry three times.

02:17:19.481 --> 02:17:20.982
Wait until the third cry.

02:17:27.072 --> 02:17:33.203
You say you'll leave me alone and go?

02:17:35.080 --> 02:17:36.331
Yes.

02:17:40.961 --> 02:17:42.712
Two more.

02:17:47.676 --> 02:17:49.302
Do not waver.

02:17:54.140 --> 02:17:56.351
You'll just leave?

02:17:56.977 --> 02:17:58.103
Yes.

02:17:58.728 --> 02:18:00.730
I will leave you alone.

02:18:20.750 --> 02:18:24.796
Who said I will let you leave?

02:18:28.717 --> 02:18:32.721
Then, let me ask you one thing.

02:18:33.346 --> 02:18:35.348
- What?
- So why...

02:18:36.891 --> 02:18:38.977
Why the hell is he doing this?

02:18:39.728 --> 02:18:43.815
Because her father has sinned.

02:18:44.399 --> 02:18:45.400
What sin?

02:18:48.069 --> 02:18:49.612
What sin did I commit?

02:18:50.238 --> 02:18:54.242
Her father suspected another,

02:18:54.826 --> 02:18:58.955
tried to kill him,
and finally did kill him.

02:18:59.581 --> 02:19:03.877
But my daughter...

02:19:05.420 --> 02:19:06.504
My daughter...

02:19:07.422 --> 02:19:10.091
My daughter got sick first!

02:19:10.717 --> 02:19:12.510
How can that...

02:19:20.477 --> 02:19:21.602
How can that possibly...

02:19:21.603 --> 02:19:24.773
One more now.

02:19:33.031 --> 02:19:34.157
How can that be...

02:19:55.970 --> 02:19:57.180
Don't do it.

02:19:59.641 --> 02:20:01.726
What are you saying?

02:20:02.685 --> 02:20:06.689
Whether you walk out of here or not
is not up to you.

02:20:15.615 --> 02:20:18.326
"Touch me and see.

02:20:22.330 --> 02:20:26.668
A ghost does not have flesh and bones,

02:20:27.710 --> 02:20:34.509
as you see I have."

02:20:59.784 --> 02:21:01.953
PARK CHUN-BAE

02:21:03.371 --> 02:21:04.497
No.

02:21:05.832 --> 02:21:07.041
That's not it.

02:21:10.295 --> 02:21:12.671
- It's you.
- No.

02:21:12.672 --> 02:21:14.716
This is all your doing.

02:21:20.221 --> 02:21:22.223
- Don't do it.
- Hyo-jin...

02:21:24.225 --> 02:21:25.435
Don't do it.

02:21:26.144 --> 02:21:27.145
Hyo-jin!

02:21:28.229 --> 02:21:31.399
No!

02:21:41.284 --> 02:21:42.452
What are you doing?

02:21:44.787 --> 02:21:45.955
Don't!

02:21:46.623 --> 02:21:48.750
"Why are you troubled?"

02:22:14.692 --> 02:22:15.693
Hyo-jin.

02:22:28.581 --> 02:22:29.666
Honey...

02:22:33.086 --> 02:22:34.128
Mother...

02:24:30.828 --> 02:24:32.955
Look at me. Look at me!

02:24:33.581 --> 02:24:35.958
Look at me!

02:24:37.043 --> 02:24:39.087
Please. Look at me.

02:24:39.587 --> 02:24:42.256
Look at me! Look at me!

02:24:43.883 --> 02:24:44.884
Please...

02:24:45.885 --> 02:24:47.762
Please!

02:25:08.032 --> 02:25:09.742
Hyo-jin!

02:25:10.952 --> 02:25:13.287
Hyo-jin! Hyo-jin!

02:25:21.129 --> 02:25:22.130
Hyo-jin.

02:25:28.010 --> 02:25:29.137
Hyo-jin.

02:25:32.265 --> 02:25:33.808
Hyo-jin!

02:25:37.145 --> 02:25:39.981
Hyo-jin!

02:25:55.872 --> 02:25:59.959
"Why do doubts arise in your hearts?

02:26:13.890 --> 02:26:16.642
See my hands and my feet.

02:26:33.034 --> 02:26:34.786
That it is I...

02:26:43.669 --> 02:26:45.296
myself."

02:27:02.063 --> 02:27:03.231
Oh, Lord.

02:29:12.610 --> 02:29:13.861
Hyo-jin...

02:29:53.401 --> 02:29:55.069
It's okay.

02:30:00.408 --> 02:30:02.702
My baby.

02:30:07.540 --> 02:30:12.545
You know Daddy's a policeman.

02:30:15.589 --> 02:30:20.594
I'll take care of everything.

02:30:28.102 --> 02:30:30.021
Daddy will.
